      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹11.46 (down from ₹12.61 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹290.7m (up 24% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹23.2m (down 12% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 8.0% (down from 11% in 3Q 2025). Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 46% per year but the company’s share price has only increased by 28% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings growth.",
